cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: BioDynaX.jl
abstract: >-
  Research preview (not v1.0). Graph-guided hybrid universal differential
  equations: known kinetics stay compiled; unknown destruction D(z) is
  recovered locally. The gated claim is true-monomial recall plus hybrid
  residual versus data on Hill-class edges, not canonical Hill from a
  trained neural network, and not a general CRN or SINDy replacement.
